     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to install the below packages, but facing some issues as mentioned below. Did anyone faced similar issues?</div><div><br></div><div>I need to get the below three packages installed on Linux (Red Hat)</div><div><ul><li><a href=\"http://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://nodejs.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fi6wZwEta_O7G4qTHMBdy\">Node.js 0.8.16 or later</a><ul><li>For Ubuntu, we have found <a href=\"https://github.com/joyent/node/wiki/Installing-Node.js-via-package-manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/joyent/node/wiki/Installing-Node.js-via-package-manager&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Q0RqVPuSs28WWZD-cykBJ\">these instructions</a> to work well.</li><li>For Red Hat/CentOS, we recommend <a href=\"https://github.com/joyent/node/wiki/Installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/joyent/node/wiki/Installation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0d9reGjjGdavHdaUmo6TWf\">installing from source</a>.</li></ul></li><li><a href=\"http://www.r-project.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-project.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RfiG8t3BkBI4XMeATMoB8\">R 2.15 or later</a></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1D9ceoLKep0CMys4QAdjZd\">Shiny</a> R package, <strong>installed into the machine-wide site library</strong>. This is one easy way to do that:<br><code>sudo su - -c &quot;R -e \\&quot;install.packages(&#39;shiny&#39;, repos=&#39;<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08EbiI9x__eHEUwjszp3Kq\">http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;</a>)\\&quot;&quot;</code></li></ul></div><div><b>1. Node.js</b></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"word-wrap:break-word;width:744px\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">echo</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;export PATH=$HOME/local/bin:$PATH&#39;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.bashrc</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">. ~/.bashrc</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">mkdir ~/local</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">mkdir ~/node-latest-install</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">cd</span> ~/node-latest-install</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">curl <a href=\"http://nodejs.org/dist/node-latest.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://nodejs.org/dist/node-latest.tar.gz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0brtRVIcJACCjRrZVb0TZi\">http://nodejs.org/dist/node-latest.tar.gz</a> | tar xz --strip-components<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>1   </div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier, monospace\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"line-height:16px\"><b style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">Got this issue when executed the above command - &gt; curl: (6) Couldn&#39;t resolve host &#39;<a href=\"http://nodejs.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://nodejs.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0KlfrzO0bDoxc3Rj_cCD8M\">nodejs.org</a>&#39;</b>\r\n</span></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">./configure --prefix<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>~/local</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">make install <span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\"># ok, fine, this step probably takes more than 30 seconds...</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">curl <a href=\"https://npmjs.org/install.sh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://npmjs.org/install.sh&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QT2Ht0F4My2nasUoDtXyR\">https://npmjs.org/install.sh</a> | sh</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><b>2. R packages</b></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier, monospace\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"line-height:16px\">I have downloaded </span></font><a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com/src/base/R-3/R-3.0.0.tar.gz\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:17px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com/src/base/R-3/R-3.0.0.tar.gz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PpNlqVqkRGemAuoAKICe0\">R-3.0.0.tar.gz</a><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\">  from <a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408960553000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lRT6iYMtavrP_qBjPGhWM\">http://cran.rstudio.com/</a> . I have extracted the files and tried to run ./configure as per </span></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\">the </span></font><span style=\"line-height:17px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">instructions in the install file. I got the following error once i run the command ./configure  -&gt; <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\"><b>configure: error: cannot find install-sh, install.sh, or shtool in tools &quot;.&quot;/tools</b></span></span></div><div><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">3. Please provide the instructions for setting up Shiny Server too</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\">Thanks for your time!</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px\"><br></div></pre></div>"
